## Обработка ошибок

### Try/Except
```python
# ✅ Явная обработка ошибок
try:
    response = await self.client.chat.completions.create(...)
    return response.choices[0].message.content
except Exception as e:
    logger.error(f"Ошибка: {e}", exc_info=True)
    return None

# ❌ Не игнорируй ошибки
response = await self.client.chat.completions.create(...)
return response.choices[0].message.content
```

